Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:37.93,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1476,870,1506,891,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:43.13,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikyuu wo sukuu shimei o obite tatakau otoko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:43.13,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Men fight on a mission to save Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:45.88,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Moeru roman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.13,0:00:45.88,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{moeru roman}It's a burning passion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.22,0:00:52.53,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.22,0:00:52.53,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu}Someone has to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:01:00.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:01:00.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba}We are the trusted ones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:08.32,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:08.32,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.32,0:01:15.34,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.32,0:01:15.34,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:44.88,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{hakai}{\c&HF7FDAB&}As soon as Golem is damaged, it begins to sing…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:51.41,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{jinzou}{\c&H00FF00&}…the song of destruction which will kill manmade cells…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.36,0:01:55.14,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{ucyuu}{\c&HF7FDAB&}…that echoes through the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.62,0:02:31.13,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Gatlantis fleet formation has been broken. Their communications have gone silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:32.84,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,They're completely out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:34.88,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,So finally…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:37.24,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,All ships, leave the battlefield !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:15.82,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,As I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:21.73,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,The Gatlantian who has eaten the seed of wisdom,\Nis not allowed to go with the rest, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:44.88,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai, do you hear me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:46.90,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The assault team should \Nwithdraw as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.66,0:03:50.88,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,This is not just the effect from Golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:57.70,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{michi}Something unknown is destroying the imperial capital,\N and absorbing everything around it, including the energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.13,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:07.64,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}...the Ark of Destruction is spontaneously\N consuming the imperial capital…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:15.08,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Lieutenant Keyman, get back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:16.40,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}At this rate, the Yamato…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:17.48,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,First Officer Sanada...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:20.02,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,...I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:30.83,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,To destroy an evil species, and\N fulfill the duty given by the creator…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:36.50,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,…the Ark of Destruction always\Nevolves to take the optimal shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:45.88,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Whether it houses dwellers like \NGatlantis or not, is not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:51.06,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{hitsuyou}It only needs a judge who\Nprompts the destruction…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:57.36,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,…based on the will of a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.36,0:04:57.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.91,0:05:00.63,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I am a human !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.83,0:05:06.37,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I demand the true awakening\N of the Ark of Destruction !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:27.61,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Kodai, are you alright ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:33.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:34.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Zorder !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:42.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Zorder, don't !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:47.95,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Kodai, we're leaving !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:51.50,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Zorder !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.49,0:06:17.88,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Assault team, withdraw at will !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.37,0:06:20.63,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,The Yamato has sustained\N serious damage to the engine...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:23.22,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,...and its internal pressure is reaching critical !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.47,0:06:25.88,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,I've never done this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:28.10,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,I don't know how long it'll last.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:32.31,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Mr. Tokugawa…Yamato…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:36.78,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Everything is getting sucked into the\Nopening of the gravitational core !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.32,0:06:40.79,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The energy signature of the imperial \Ncapital is getting even stronger !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.91,0:06:45.68,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,That's the Ark of Destruction…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:06:59.88,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Kodai…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:01.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Mr. Sanada…?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:06.23,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The only way to stop this monster is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.43,0:07:13.48,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...to destroy its energy converter from the\N inside before it finishes the energy conversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:16.16,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,That's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:18.24,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,From inside…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:24.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Keyman !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:29.54,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}This must be fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.66,0:07:35.28,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}My ship's loaded with the last of the \Nwave motion excavator warheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:42.08,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{sennen}That thing is absorbing everything to\N satisfy a thousand years of hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.63,0:07:43.31,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Now is the chance…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.31,0:07:44.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Wait, Keyman !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:47.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That's not your call !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.63,0:07:51.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}I'll do it ! \NTurn around, Keyman !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:58.17,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}I beg you. I don't want \Nto lose anyone anymore !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:27.28,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Your travel buddy's here, Gammy !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:33.63,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,All fighter unit pilots, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:38.20,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}...escort Captain Kodai back to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:40.35,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}He has so much left to…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:41.53,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,This is too sad !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.41,0:08:47.33,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}As always, you live for someone else...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.13,0:08:49.38,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}...instead of living...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.23,0:08:54.61,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,...the life that's best for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:57.78,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:05.20,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}It's even more sad if you only \Nlive for your own benefit, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:11.05,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{minna}Everyone lives, searching \Nfor something precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.83,0:09:16.85,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{sore}If you think you're going to\N lose it, you'd risk your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:23.45,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What else can I do,\N now that I've found it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:26.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:30.23,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Kodai, please let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:34.58,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Treat him like a human until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:43.17,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Kodai ! You'd better\N listen to my wifey…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:46.58,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}…or you'll get your ass kicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.19,0:09:48.30,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Saito…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.06,0:09:51.45,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Please, for our sake…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.94,0:09:53.43,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Grab the future with your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.13,0:10:15.61,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Gammy, hurry, but be calm and precise !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.21,0:10:23.38,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Akira, I never thought\N I was sad because…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.89,0:10:31.15,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}...I didn't have anyone who\N made me sad of losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.50,0:10:39.29,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}But now, I'm sad that \NI can't hear your voice…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:43.54,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}…sad that I can't see your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.78,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I guess it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:58.90,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}The more you gain and feel happy, \Nthe greater the sadness becomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:14.54,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Commander, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:23.84,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I'll embrace the sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.85,0:11:47.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yamamoto !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:28.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Saito, Keyman…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:04.55,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Is...is that…?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:38.73,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}As I said, you can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.73,0:13:45.96,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}You and humanity\N lost your future long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.33,0:13:49.98,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}Accept your salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.98,0:13:54.64,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the only salvation that\N can end your suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:13:59.96,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.21,0:14:09.21,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is farewell to the warriors of Earth, \Nthe ones who won't pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:13.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Gatlantis is heading to Saturn's coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:18.79,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's going to convert the remaining\N core of Saturn to attack Earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:24.04,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We have no means left to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.94,0:14:34.93,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,All hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:35.84,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...abandon ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:47.59,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Earth might lose its planetary\N function with the next attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,But, even so…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.67,0:14:58.25,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...every one of us must live\N for as long as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:04.89,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{tatoe}Even if such a choice\N is harder than dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.65,0:15:20.56,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Humanity must live on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:25.72,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Kodai…!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:31.68,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Kodai stayed behind !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.10,0:15:37.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,As long as we have a chance…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:49.63,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}I've heard of Plan G.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:53.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}I want you to leave the Solar System as\N soon as possible to look for a new Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:56.43,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.43,0:15:58.58,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Captain Kodai, you are…!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.93,0:16:15.79,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Mr. Okita…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:21.55,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,…I'll hear your recrimination once I join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.80,0:16:32.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki, why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.43,0:16:36.59,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You disobeyed the evacuation order…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:41.94,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'll navigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:46.18,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Crash the Yamato into it, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:53.43,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{rinkai}Even the near-critical wave motion engine\N won't be able to destroy a mass that large.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.43,0:17:03.14,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{demo}But you can get time to evacuate as many people\N as possible from Earth before the core recharges…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:05.33,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:07.63,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.63,0:17:09.63,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,…don't remember you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:15.94,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,...but I know that's what's on your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:17.94,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:20.08,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:22.33,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,...you can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:54.18,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,The Yamato's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:55.58,def2,TODO,0,0,0,,We can't waste this chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:17:58.26,def2,TODO,0,0,0,,Speed up the evacuation plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.76,0:18:06.23,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}A thousand years ago,\N you reactivated the Ark of Destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:09.97,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you know why you were able to do it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:13.48,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because you're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.43,0:18:19.38,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because you are human, you hate\N people and try to annihilate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.67,0:18:26.46,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because you are human, you\N love and try to protect humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:31.73,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Wave motion engine, \Ninternal pressure 250%.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:37.05,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,The reactor is near critical, but we \Ncan still reach the Ark of Destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:04.13,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,So warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:08.31,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.59,0:19:11.04,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:40.95,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,That light…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:46.72,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Teresa…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:51.03,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Memories are mere sediment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:55.84,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Love gives birth to humans, and builds fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:10.37,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything follows its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.91,0:20:15.75,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}And my fate with you\N has brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.23,0:20:25.89,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The out-of-control wave motion engine opened\Na hole to a higher dimension, and brought Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.43,0:20:29.63,def2,SANDADA,0,0,0,,Is it a one-in-a-million coincidence...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.63,0:20:32.07,def2,SANDADA,0,0,0,,...or inevitability ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:39.83,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{kono}The Yamato is a vessel that can\N bring Teresa to our universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.29,0:20:47.18,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}A strong will can change\N the pre-determined future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.34,0:20:54.50,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Another strong will was \Nnecessary to change the course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:07.31,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}One missing person, and\N I wouldn't be able to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.33,0:21:24.61,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}I also am a part of the great harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.59,0:21:31.65,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's go together for the sake of all\Nliving things which build the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.33,0:22:45.68,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(222,872)}Episode 25
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.33,0:22:45.68,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(380,1046)} Farewell, Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.23,0:23:18.63,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Cottony clouds drift high across the sky\N{\i1}Sora takaku nagareru kieyuku wata no kumo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.63,0:23:31.39,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Holding out both hands, I stretch out in the falling leaves\N{\i1}Ryoote wo age ah senobi shita rakuyou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.66,0:23:51.69,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}As the house lights come on, I wish to meet people smiling at each other\N{\i1}Akari tomoru mado waraiau hito ni aitai to omou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.69,0:24:05.82,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Believing in a miraculous enounter{meeting} to become real, I shout out for love\N{\i1}Sou kanau hazusa kiseki no deai ni ai sakenda
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.80,0:24:25.78,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Luminous lives meet and bond with each other\N{\i1}Kagayaku jinsei no meguriawase tsumuideyuku
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.78,0:24:41.81,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Let’s keep on living our lives\N{\i1}Bokura no jinsei wo tayumazu ni susumi tsuzukeyou
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.81,0:25:02.43,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Let’s begin the story of our lives\N{\i1}Bokura no jinsei no monogatari wo saa hajimeyou
