Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.53,0:25:35.29,def2,Kodai,0,0,0,,I pulled the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.29,0:25:36.02,def2,Yuki,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.03,0:25:37.23,def2,Saki,0,0,0,,What a mess…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.23,0:25:39.87,def2,Sanada,0,0,0,,We might be being tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.87,0:25:41.08,def2,Shima,0,0,0,,We've got things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.08,0:25:46.90,def2,Teresa,0,0,0,,{\i1}{subete}Everything's determined by your desire.\NYou can have your ideal world if you so wish.
